{"provider":"github","id":"7277","externalId":"5819175807","revision":"2026-10-12T19:50:20Z","type":"issue","title":"gaggletemplate: write source.yaml atomically","body":"## Problem\ngaggletemplate: write source.yaml atomically\n\n**Location:** internal/gaggletemplate/metadata.go:163 (writeSource)\n\n## Evidence\n`os.WriteFile(path, data, 0644)` for source.yaml while sibling files use durability.WriteFileAtomic. A crash leaves a truncated file that hasTracking treats as enrolled. (Symlink-following angle is low confidence/unverified.)\n22\n\n## Proposed scope\nUse durability.WriteFileAtomic for source.yaml, with a test for the write path.\n\n## Acceptance sketch\n- Deterministic tests in the same package cover the behaviour; `go test` for the package passes.\n\nCategory: reliability\nConfidence: high; lens(es): 20 (quality-sprint collated findings)\n\nNomination key: qs/21\n","labels":["area:hygiene","goobers:approved","goobers:ready","goobers:claimed","goobers:nominated","type:bug","goobers:cloud"],"state":"open","status":"open","links":[{"rel":"self","url":"https://github.com/Agent-Clubhouse/Goobers/issues/7277"}],"url":"https://github.com/Agent-Clubhouse/Goobers/issues/7277","createdAt":"2026-10-12T19:17:22Z","updatedAt":"2026-10-12T19:50:20Z","readyAt":"2026-10-12T19:40:59Z","fields":{"comments":4,"created_at":"2026-10-12T19:17:22Z","id":5819175807,"issue_dependencies_summary.total_blocked_by":0,"locked":false,"number":7277,"state":"open","title":"gaggletemplate: write source.yaml atomically","updated_at":"2026-10-12T19:50:20Z","user.login":"goobersbot[bot]"},"raw":{"id":5819175807,"number":7277,"title":"gaggletemplate: write source.yaml atomically","body":"## Problem\ngaggletemplate: write source.yaml atomically\n\n**Location:** internal/gaggletemplate/metadata.go:163 (writeSource)\n\n## Evidence\n`os.WriteFile(path, data, 0644)` for source.yaml while sibling files use durability.WriteFileAtomic. A crash leaves a truncated file that hasTracking treats as enrolled. (Symlink-following angle is low confidence/unverified.)\n22\n\n## Proposed scope\nUse durability.WriteFileAtomic for source.yaml, with a test for the write path.\n\n## Acceptance sketch\n- Deterministic tests in the same package cover the behaviour; `go test` for the package passes.\n\nCategory: reliability\nConfidence: high; lens(es): 20 (quality-sprint collated findings)\n\nNomination key: qs/21\n","state":"open","state_reason":"","locked":false,"comments":4,"html_url":"https://github.com/Agent-Clubhouse/Goobers/issues/7277","user":{"login":"goobersbot[bot]","type":"Bot"},"labels":[{"name":"area:hygiene","color":"c5def5","description":"Repo/design cleanup, quarantine, docs"},{"name":"goobers:approved","color":"0E8A16","description":"Maintainer-approved — eligible for curation/implementation (SEC-047)"},{"name":"goobers:ready","color":"1D76DB","description":"Curated and scoped — eligible for implementation"},{"name":"goobers:claimed","color":"FBCA04","description":"Currently claimed by an in-flight run"},{"name":"goobers:nominated","color":"5319E7","description":"Filed by the nominator — awaiting maintainer approval"},{"name":"type:bug","color":"D73A4A","description":"Defect in existing behavior"},{"name":"goobers:cloud","color":"1d76db","description":"Claim-partition: issue belongs to the cloud (Goobernetes) instance"}],"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"created_at":"2026-10-12T19:17:22Z","updated_at":"2026-10-12T19:50:20Z","issue_dependencies_summary":{"total_blocked_by":0},"pull_request":null},"integrity":"maintainer"}